    {
      "offset": 1346,
      "text": "Wealth is defined as the total accumulation of money, savings, and investments. Try the stock market, and be on the watch for Wild Willy. And most importantly... sorry, out of room.",
      "terminated": true
    },
    {
      "offset": 1528,
      "text": "Happiness is accumulated by acquiring goods, achieving goals, taking time off from work, and helping little old ladies cross the street so that they don't get hit by any speeding marbles.",
      "terminated": true
    },
    {
      "offset": 1716,
      "text": "Education is accumulated by attending the university and graduating from the classes offered. A computer and some reference books can be very beneficial to your studies.",
      "terminated": true
    },
    {
      "offset": 1886,
      "text": "Career is achieved by working hard, climbing the corporate ladder, improving your skills, dependability, and advancing your education. Remember, hire a kid, they have all the answers.",
